I try to avoid praying unless I *know* that my god is tickled pink.  If 
you've just prayed, you should probably stay at the altar and sacrifice
everything that comes by until your sacrifices are accepted.  Then you
should leave without praying.  That way, when you next need to pray, 
your god will be inclined to answer.
